    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n94673" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλλω</span></b> , aor. 1
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσκηλα</span>, opt. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκήλειε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
				</span></i>
			 (v. infr.), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσκειλα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Zonar.
				</span></i>
			:— 
				Pass.
			, v. infr. <i><span class="en">
				11
			</span></i>:—<i>dry up, parch</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μὴ μένος ἠελίοιο σκήλει᾽ ἀμφὶ περὶ
					χρόα ἴνεσιν ἠδὲ μέλεσσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					23.191
				</span></i>
			; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνσκέλλω</span>.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέλλομαι </span>(
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					481
				</span></i>
			): fut.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκελοῦμαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hsch.
				</span></i>
			: intr. pf.
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔσκληκα</span> in pres. signf.
			(in compds. also with intr. aor. 2
			
				Act.
			
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκλῆναι</span>, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκλῆναι</span>):— <i>to be parched, lean,
				dry</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκληκότα καπνῷ</span>
				smoke-<i>dried</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Choeril.
				4
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Th.</u>
				718
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρὼς ἐσκλήκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					2.201
				</span></i>
			; 
				Ep.
			
			part. nom. pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐσκληῶτες</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				53
			</span></i>.</div>
